{{Quote|The Arena is a certified butterfly-free zone. No distractions for P.E.K.K.A, only destruction.}}

The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was a temporary {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]], only available in certain Events. It spawned a fast, single-target, ground-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with high hitpoints and extremely high damage. Every 5 seconds, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A would passively summon a pancake that heals himself and all friendly troops within a small radius. He would also spawn a pancake every time he managed to defeat an enemy troop. A Super Mini P.E.K.K.A card cost 5 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

==Strategy==
{{Battle Deck with Card|:Category:Battle Decks using the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A. Card}}
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A deals damage that vastly outnumbers every unit in the game, essentially being able to OHKO everything including the [[King's Tower]], meaning he must never be ignored under any circumstances.
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A's pancakes can be used to heal damaged support [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], helping to strengthen a push.
*Like the Mini P.E.K.K.A, [[Skeleton Army]], [[Goblin Gang]], [[Guards]], [[Skeletons/Evolution|Evolved Skeletons]], [[Barbarians/Evolution|Evolved Barbarians]], and [[Royal Recruits]] do well against him, but additional support may be needed because of the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A's healing ability.
**[[Graveyard]], however, may be the best counter against him, due to the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A having a slow hit speed and being unable to inflict area damage, and its ability to spawn Skeletons for long enough to kill the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A despite his healing ability.
*Freezing a Super Mini P.E.K.K.A will prevent him from spawning any pancakes.
*In a 1v1 situation between two Super Mini P.E.K.K.As, a stun or a slowing effect can be used to stall the enemy Super Mini P.E.K.K.A. for long enough for the player's one to destroy him without taking any damage. While this would be a negative [[Elixir]] trade, your surviving Super Mini P.E.K.K.A would gain more value afterwards from a counterattack.
*[[Freeze]] also works with the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A as when deployed, Freeze can be used to freeze surrounding threatening troops like [[Super Archers]] and the [[Super Magic Archer]] who the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A will clear off and then probably the [[:Category:Tower Troop Cards|Crown Tower]].

