==History==
2022
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A [[Cards|card]] was made available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Super Mini P.E.K.K.A Challenge]] on 15/7/2022.
*On 21/7/2022, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was removed from the game.
2023
*On 10/4/2023, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was readded to the game in the Super Cards Triple Draft Event.
*On 18/4/2023, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was removed from the game.
2024

* On 19/8/2024, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
* On 26/8/2024, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was removed from the game.
* On 30/9/2024, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was readded to the game in the Super Welterweight Event.
* On 7/10/2024, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was removed from the game.
2025
*On 27/1/2025, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 3/2/2025, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A was removed from the game.

