==Trivia==
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A's name derives from the Finnish name for "''Peter''", which in turn comes from the Greek name "''Petros''", meaning stone.
*The acronym for P.E.K.K.A doesn't officially stand for anything in particular originally. Supercell held a Facebook contest on 22 August 2012 to see who could come up with the best written-out name for P.E.K.K.A as judged by the number of likes the comment received. The name "''Perfectly Enraged Knight Killer of Assassins''" was the winner. The person who submitted the acronym was called Víctor in the [https://www.facebook.com/ClashofClans/photos/478339952190333 Facebook announcement].
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A is likely inspired from [https://youtu.be/aFrk-wDjJ4w?t=500 a scrapped card concept] called Mega P.E.K.K.A. In particular, it resembles the first iteration of the Mega P.E.K.K.A, which had infinite damage.
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A's stats are the highest or lowest among all [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]]. More specifically:
**The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A has the highest damage of all troops, with 175,998 damage at Level 15.
***It is theoretically possible to win a [[Basics of Battle|battle]] with just a Super Mini P.E.K.K.A, due to his ability to OHKO [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]] and spawning pancakes overtime to heal, and is 1 of 2 troops that can do a 3-Crown victory by himself at even Levels, along with the [[Princess]].
**Among all troops that attack with projectiles, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A has the highest projectile speed of all troops, with a projectile speed of 3000.
*In the Arabic, Thai, and Finnish language settings of the game, the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A's name translates to "Super Small P.E.K.K.A", "Super Tiny P.E.K.K.A", and "Super Little P.E.K.K.A" respectively.
*His description is a reference to the Clash of Clans [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nmlIkSvezkU P.E.K.K.A commercial].
**Even though his description states that the [[Arenas|Arena]] is a butterfly-free zone, a butterfly can be seen flying in the [[Training Camp]] picture.
*According to the [https://youtu.be/44vl4-o6z1U?si=C0lXmAKd49tyqfJq Super Mini P.E.K.K.A trailer], the Super Mini P.E.K.K.A gained his powers by eating a pancake.
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A has the same attack and deploy sound as the [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.EK.K.A]], but with a lower pitch. His pancakes have a unique sound, with a choir singing “''Pancakes''”.
**The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being Mini P.E.K.K.A., [[Mega Minion]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Dark Prince]], [[Bowler]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], [[Fisherman]], [[Goblin Machine]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Little Prince]], and the [[Terry]].
*The Super Mini P.E.K.K.A. has the longest name in English, with 21 characters (including the empty space characters in the name).

